flowchart TB
    Client[Browser / Vue SPA] --> Gateway[API Gateway]
    Gateway --> Identity[Identity Service\nAUTH\nAuthentication principal]
    Gateway --> Course[Course Service\nCRS\nCourses and membership]
    Gateway --> Assessment[Assessment Service\nLAB + HWK]
    Gateway --> LearningGrade[Learning and Grade Service\nLRN + GRD]

    Assessment -->|canManageCourse\nisCourseMember\ncourse roster| Course
    Assessment -->|LAB_EXPERIMENT_PUBLISHED\nLAB_SUBMISSION_SCORED\nEXPERIMENT_SCORE_PUBLISHED\nHOMEWORK_* events| LearningGrade
    LearningGrade -->|SourceGradeDTO query\nfor published or archived sources| Assessment

    subgraph AssessmentScope[Assessment Service ownership]
        Lab[LAB lifecycle\nDB-LAB-01 to DB-LAB-09]
        Hwk[HWK lifecycle\nDB-HWK-01 to DB-HWK-08]
        Evaluator[Evaluation kernel\nEvaluationTask / Evaluator\nSandboxExecutor / EvaluationResult]
        Storage[Assessment storage adapter\nsource files, reports, attachments]
        Lab --> Evaluator
        Hwk --> Evaluator
        Lab --> Storage
        Hwk --> Storage
    end

    Assessment --- AssessmentScope
    Assessment --> AssessmentDb[(assessment schema\nLAB and HWK tables)]
    Assessment --> Docker[Docker or Fake sandbox]

    Identity --> IdentityDb[(identity schema\nDB-AUTH-*)]
    Course --> CourseDb[(course schema\nDB-CRS-*)]
    LearningGrade --> LearningGradeDb[(learning-grade schema\nDB-LRN-* and DB-GRD-*)]

    classDef service fill:#e8f3ff,stroke:#1d5d9b,color:#172b4d
    classDef assessment fill:#e8f7ed,stroke:#217a3c,color:#153d24
    classDef data fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#9a6a00,color:#4b3200
    class Gateway,Identity,Course,LearningGrade service
    class Assessment,Lab,Hwk,Evaluator,Storage assessment
    class AssessmentDb,IdentityDb,CourseDb,LearningGradeDb data
